e":{}}},"widgets_values":[4,"fixed"]},{"id":17,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[2590,180],"size":[270,90],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vae名称","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":0,"links":[20,15015,15017,15027]}],"title":"Qwen VAE","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAELoader","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"vae_name":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"]},{"id":18,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[4530,0],"size":[230,80],"flags":{},"order":28,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":15112},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":20}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[15083]}],"title":"主结果 解码","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":35,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,0],"size":[800,3060],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"模型下载与说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["**《七纹刻印》文生图工作流 · Qwen-Image-2512 + Flux.2 Klein 分块重绘**\n\n---\n\n## 一、文生图(主生成)\n\n- 模型:qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn + LoRA Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-fp32\n- 文本编码:qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled(qwen_image)· VAE:qwen_image_vae\n- 采样:euler / simple · ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3.1\n\n### 4步/20步一键切换(「是否4步生成」开关)\n\n| 模式 | 步数 | CFG | LoRA |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 20步标准 | 20 | 2.5 | 关 |\n| 4步加速 | 4 | 1.0 | Lightning-4steps |\n\n- 种子在 KSampler 手动设置:randomize 随机 / fixed 固定\n- 提示:4步模式 CFG=1,负面提示词不生效属正常现象\n\n## 二、元素选择(当前 208 个)\n\n- 元素选择器:208 项下拉(33 人物 + 52 场景 + 70 怪物 + 47 物品 + 6 植物),选中即输出索引\n- 「通用表格」节点:208 行表格(A/B/C/D/E 五列: 正|负|宽|高|批次),按索引取行,只输出选中那一行\n  - 所有类型统一 16:9 = 1344×768(H3 768p 桶) · 9:16 = 768×1344\n  - 输出 正/负 + 宽高/批次;宽高/批次接官方 EmptySD3LatentImage(16ch,/8,兼容 Qwen/Flux)生成潜空间后进 KSampler\n\n\n### 生图尺寸选择依据(H3 优先,兼容 Qwen-Image)\n\n- 尺寸统一按 **H3 视频 canvas 需求** 填写(短边 ≤768、面积 ≤768×1344、每轴 32 的倍数),生成图直接作为 H3 视频首帧/参考图,无需缩放:\n  - 默认统一 16:9 = **1344×768**(H3 768p 主推桶)\n  - 9:16 竖版 = **768×1344**\n- 上述尺寸同时兼容 Qwen-Image:像素为 16 的倍数(VAE 8×8 下采样对齐:1344/16=84、768/16=48),可直接生成\n- 注:Qwen-Image 官方训练甜区桶(总像素约 1.5~1.8MP,如 16:9 = 1664×928)仅用于独立出大图;凡要进入 H3 视频流程的图一律用 H3 桶(1344×768 / 768×1344)\n- 超过约 1.8MP 直接生成属分布外,易出现重复物体/结构崩坏;高清路线统一走 4x 外部放大 + Klein 分块重绘\n\n\n### Qwen-Image-Edit 修线分辨率要求(官方+源码核实,2026-08-06)\n\n- 官方 API 输入:总像素 512×512~2048×2048,最佳 ~1MP(1024² 量级),宽高 384~2048px,单图 ≤10MB;参考图自动缩 1MP\n- ComfyUI 原生:输出 = 输入分辨率(VAEEncode 输入图尺寸);官方推荐输出 6 档:1024² / 1024×1280 / 1280×1024 / 1280² / 1280×1536 / 1536×1080\n- 本流修线:6K 分块图 → ImageScaleBy 0.25(≈1.5K/2.4MP)→ Edit 重绘 → 输出 1.5K;超过 4MP 直接进 Edit 会把大图当图层放中央,勿跳过缩小\n- 超高分辨率输出:Eric_Qwen_Edit_Experiments(16MP)或分块重绘\n\n## 三、分块重绘(Flux.2 Klein 9B 蒸馏)\n\n- 模型:flux-2-klein-9b-fp8 · 文本编码:qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed(flux2)· VAE:full_encoder_small_decoder\n- 重绘提示词(正):中文通用描述,严格保持原图整体风格、构图、色彩与全部内容(人物/场景/物体),只提升细节、抹平拼接痕迹,不乱画;负向清零(ConditioningZeroOut)\n- 链路:Flux2Scheduler(8步/1024)→ SplitSigmasDenoise(denoise 0.3)→ UltimateSDUpscaleGuider → ColorMatch → 重绘后预览\n- KSamplerSelect euler · CFGGuider=1(蒸馏模型)\n- 分块参数:4x(4xNomos8kDAT)· tile 1024×1024 · tile_padding 192 · mask_blur 16\n- 颜色匹配回原图:ColorMatch(mkl / strength 1.0,参考图经 4x lanczos 缩放)\n\n### 分段执行\n\n- 分段1「继续: 放大前」:第一次预览(原图)后暂停,点「▶ 继续」执行外部 4x 放大并预览放大图;分段2「继续: 分块重绘前」:放大图预览后暂停,点「▶ 继续」才进入分块重绘;均支持「↻ 重跑(从本节点)」\n\n### 参数速调\n\n- denoise(0.3):越低越保真;0.2 更强保真,0.5 重绘更强\n- tile 1024:显存紧张降 768;充裕可 1536\n- 方块格子/接缝明显 → 降 denoise、加大 tile_padding、提高 mask_blur\n- 风格被改写成写实 → 降低 denoise,或加强重绘提示词(30)\n\n## 四、模型清单与下载\n\n| 文件 | 目录 | 下载 |\n|---|---|---|\n| qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors | models/diffusion_models/ | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors |\n| qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors | models/text_encoders/ | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors |\n| qwen_image_vae.safetensors | models/vae/ | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors |\n| Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-fp32.safetensors | models/loras/ | https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-fp32.safetensors |\n| 4xNomos8kDAT.safetensors(~147MB) | models/upscale_models/ | [HF 直链](https://huggingface.co/Phips/4xNomos8kDAT/resolve/main/4xNomos8kDAT.safetensors) · [GitHub 镜像](https://github.com/Phhofm/models/releases/download/4xNomos8kDAT/4xNomos8kDAT.safetensors) |\n| flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors(~10GB,需 HF 登录接受 BFL 协议) | models/diffusion_models/ | https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors |\n| qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors(~8.1GB) | models/text_encoders/ | https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors |\n| full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors(~238MB) | models/vae/ | https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder/resolve/main/full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors |\n\n- HF 下载慢/被墙:把 huggingface.co 换成 hf-mirror.com,或走代理 7890;门控的扩散模型需登录后下载\n- 显存:9B 蒸馏约 19.6GB,24G 卡跑 1024 tile 偏紧;爆显存把 tile 降到 768\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":4000,"type":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","pos":[1750,0],"size":[480,700],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","type":"FALLINGTS_MD_TABLE","widget":{"name":"data"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[15096,15097]},{"name":"提示词","ty